        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"5de2cd0e-6fc3-46c7-8ece-233a6862fce8\",\"review_text\":\"went from best to worst👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"a551564e-db4a-489a-a210-1d994984150e\",\"review_text\":\"Terrible experience to be honest, 1- I have linked my google account so when i click on the google connect it says there is no account and i am sure and yave the screenshot from my account to confirms it 2- the monthly subscription is 14 days or so 3- for the past few subscriptions things were smooth BUT now the app takes the money a'd says that I need to make a paiment my renewal failed, no thts a cheap scam..... 4- nonchat support or any way to open a ticket with a support team.\"},{\"review_id\":\"71750aa8-3cb0-4573-873c-aa54c206a5f9\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app ever experienced. Became 💩💩after update\"},{\"review_id\":\"4299413b-59bb-4779-b7e2-b7718816b6ed\",\"review_text\":\"I find the podcast system confusing Why it has to be mixed with the music. Can it be a separete page? It is difficult for me to follow some podcast. And to add some of the episodes to a list? I can't do anything. Even searching\"},{\"review_id\":\"36466d05-b711-4028-a7fc-a3e7ff28349b\",\"review_text\":\"i really love playing my fav. music, its easy to search and yep keep it up Spotify!\"},{\"review_id\":\"4faaf854-ea57-4ba2-b0cb-22563250a790\",\"review_text\":\"Hat this ap without any reason 💪\"},{\"review_id\":\"4f1533b8-8b63-40e0-9237-aa3176a89558\",\"review_text\":\"Take too long to load\"},{\"review_id\":\"2b4e4d4f-b2a5-4806-8951-af61586529d2\",\"review_text\":\"giving one star due to new updates.. want to give in minus but unfortunately can't do that..\"},{\"review_id\":\"25af2715-5ae2-4568-95e7-5a7adcc28056\",\"review_text\":\"Hey dude Listen by your mood only on Spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"8ccb8135-1f06-416e-aa40-4cbd1490e1df\",\"review_text\":\"Worst👎 Aap in the world..\"}]}"
